@page
@model KopiCinta.Pages.TeamNandaModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Nanda";
}

<section class="section">
    <div class="container">

        <div class="back-top reveal">
            <a asp-page="/Team">← Back</a>
        </div>

        <div class="event-hero reveal">
            <div class="event-hero-text">
                <p class="eyebrow">Our Team</p>
                <h2>Nanda</h2>

                <p class="event-intro">
                    The golden hand—a Deaf barista who brings quality,
                    sincerity, and steady care into every part of her work.
                </p>

                <div class="event-tags">
                    <span>Deaf Barista</span>
                    <span>Quality</span>
                    <span>Sincerity</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="team-profile-hero-img reveal">
                <img src="/images/team/nanda.jpg" alt="Nanda">
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hbii-block reveal">
            <div class="hbii-block-text">
                <p class="hbii-label">Her Journey</p>
                <h3>A Space That Feels Comfortable</h3>

                <p>
                    Nanda began her journey with Kopi Cinta on November 16, 2025.
                    Before joining, she already had experience as a barista.
                </p>

                <p>
                    What drew her to Kopi Cinta was something beyond coffee—
                    a service concept that values both quality and meaning.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="hbii-block-card">
                <h4>Her Role</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li>Deaf barista</li>
                    <li>Customer service</li>
                    <li>Quality-focused preparation</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hbii-feature reveal">
            <div class="hbii-feature-card">
                <p class="hbii-label">Growth</p>
                <h3>Enjoying the Process</h3>

                <p>
                    At Kopi Cinta, Nanda found a space where she feels comfortable
                    and an environment she genuinely enjoys.
                </p>

                <p>
                    It became a place where she could continue growing
                    through every experience and every interaction.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="hbii-feature-card soft">
                <p class="hbii-label">Challenge</p>
                <h3>Communication Takes Effort</h3>

                <p>
                    As a Deaf individual, communication is one of the challenges Nanda faces.
                </p>

                <p>
                    She navigates it through written communication, lip-reading,
                    and making sure instructions are clearly understood.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hbii-ending reveal">
            <h3>Her Message</h3>
            <p>
                Nanda believes communication becomes easier when people are willing to try.
            </p>
            <p>
                For her, connection is not always about sound—
                but about the effort to understand.
            </p>
        </div>
        <br />
        <div class="detail-back reveal">
            <a asp-page="/Team" class="btn btn-secondary">← Back to Team</a>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>